      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786900000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Organised around the questions the review asks, not around the\nmodels that happen to exist. A reader looking for 'are they\nstaying' should not have to know which mart the answer lives\nin.",
